/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store

# Personal agent config kept out of the source tree.
#
# Personas resolve from two scopes: `~/.grok/personas/` (user) and
# `<cwd>/.grok/personas/` (project) — and the second one lands inside whatever
# repository the session runs in, this fork included. Nothing under `.grok/`
# is tracked here, so ignoring it costs nothing and is what stops a stray
# `git add -A` from publishing personal persona text. Prompt overrides and
# presets live under `$GROK_HOME` and never reach a git tree at all.
#
# A project that genuinely wants to share a persona still can: `git add -f`.
.grok/
